{"id":"2ec513c4de458d45","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-finite-tree-switches.md","title":"一次反向策略的有限重置界","display":"lem-finite-tree-switches — 一次反向策略的有限重置界","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-finite-tree-switches","aliases":["20-lem-finite-tree-switches"],"display":"lem-finite-tree-switches — 一次反向策略的有限重置界","chapter":"13","section":"13.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"§13.3 的策略重置归纳（本地精确计数模型）","source_printed_pages":[204],"source_pdf_pages":[234],"depends_on":["[[20-df-fininjury]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-finite-tree-switches"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-finite-tree-switches</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-finite-tree-switches — 一次反向策略的有限重置界"},{"key":"chapter","html":"13"},{"key":"section","html":"13.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§13.3 的策略重置归纳（本地精确计数模型）"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>204</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>234</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"423b4c2674336774\" href=\"?note=423b4c2674336774\" title=\"20-df-fininjury\">20-df-fininjury</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge0\">\\(k\\ge0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_k\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(R_k\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 策略的模式改变／重置事件阶段集合；令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{-1}=\\varnothing\">\\(R_{-1}=\\varnothing\\)</span>。每个上游策略 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k-1\">\\(k-1\\)</span> 不变的时间区间内，第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 策略最多一次白到黑反向；上游每次事件至多给第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 策略增加一次重置。初始化不计作重置。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"423b4c2674336774\" href=\"?note=423b4c2674336774\" title=\"20-df-fininjury\">20-df-fininjury</a>。</p>\n<p>事件集合前提精确为：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge0\">\\(k\\ge0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_k\\subseteq R_{k-1}\\cup B_k\">\\(R_k\\subseteq R_{k-1}\\cup B_k\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_k\\subseteq\\omega\\setminus R_{k-1}\">\\(B_k\\subseteq\\omega\\setminus R_{k-1}\\)</span>，并满足\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall s&lt;t\\ [(s,t\\in B_k)\\Rightarrow\\exists u\\in R_{k-1}\\ (s&lt;u&lt;t)]\">\\(\\forall s&lt;t\\ [(s,t\\in B_k)\\Rightarrow\\exists u\\in R_{k-1}\\ (s&lt;u&lt;t)]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{-1}=\\varnothing\">\\(R_{-1}=\\varnothing\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_k\">\\(B_k\\)</span> 是原模型中不与上游重置重合的自身模式改变阶段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}finite-tree-switches}\\vdash\n\\forall e\\in\\omega\\\n\\left[|R_e|&lt;\\omega\\land |R_e|\\le2^{e+1}-1\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}finite-tree-switches}\\vdash\n\\forall e\\in\\omega\\\n\\left[|R_e|&lt;\\omega\\land |R_e|\\le2^{e+1}-1\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 归纳。基例的上游没有事件，只有一个不变区间，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|R_0|\\le1\">\\(|R_0|\\le1\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{e-1}\">\\(R_{e-1}\\)</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_{e-1}\">\\(N_{e-1}\\)</span> 个事件，则时间轴被划为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_{e-1}+1\">\\(N_{e-1}+1\\)</span> 个上游不变区间；每区间至多一次自身反向，再加至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_{e-1}\">\\(N_{e-1}\\)</span> 次上游重置。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_e\">\\(R_e\\)</span> 有限，并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N_e:=|R_e|\\le (N_{e-1}+1)+N_{e-1}\n\\le2(2^e-1)+1=2^{e+1}-1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N_e:=|R_e|\\le (N_{e-1}+1)+N_{e-1}\n\\le2(2^e-1)+1=2^{e+1}-1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这同时证明有限性与数值界，不先假设需要证明的事件总数是自然数，也不把单个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 的递推不等式当成全部低阶递推已经成立。该界只适用于明示的重置模型；程序值域继续枚举的变化不算模式改变。需求满足、树全性与无限路径仍需各自的证明。</p>\n<p>来源：§13.3 / 印刷 204 / PDF 234 的有限重置策略；精确计数界为本地归纳展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-fininjury","status":"resolved","id":"423b4c2674336774","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-fininjury]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-fininjury","status":"resolved","id":"423b4c2674336774","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-fininjury]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\ge0","display":false},{"tex":"R_k\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"R_{-1}=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"k-1","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k\\ge0","display":false},{"tex":"R_k\\subseteq R_{k-1}\\cup B_k","display":false},{"tex":"B_k\\subseteq\\omega\\setminus R_{k-1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall s<t\\ [(s,t\\in B_k)\\Rightarrow\\exists u\\in R_{k-1}\\ (s<u<t)]","display":false},{"tex":"R_{-1}=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"B_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}finite-tree-switches}\\vdash\n\\forall e\\in\\omega\\\n\\left[|R_e|<\\omega\\land |R_e|\\le2^{e+1}-1\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"|R_0|\\le1","display":false},{"tex":"R_{e-1}","display":false},{"tex":"N_{e-1}","display":false},{"tex":"N_{e-1}+1","display":false},{"tex":"N_{e-1}","display":false},{"tex":"R_e","display":false},{"tex":"N_e:=|R_e|\\le (N_{e-1}+1)+N_{e-1}\n\\le2(2^e-1)+1=2^{e+1}-1.","display":true},{"tex":"e","display":false}],"bytes":2284,"backlinks":[{"id":"2e72efb02984d69c","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-splitting-procedure]]；see [[20-lem-black-node-oracle-test]]；see [[20-lem-finite-tree-switches]]；see [[20-lem-minimality-tree]]。"},{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-56","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-lem-finite-tree-switches]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-361","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-lem-finite-tree-switches]] — 章 13；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-361","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-lem-finite-tree-switches]]"}],"outgoing":["423b4c2674336774"]}